1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,047
A funnel narrows a whole market down, stage by stage,

2
00:00:03,067 --> 00:00:05,740
and keeps the list up to date every hour.

3
00:00:06,195 --> 00:00:07,711
Open Funnels.

4
00:00:07,761 --> 00:00:10,019
Angstrom's Trend funnel is ready to copy:

5
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:13,394
the pool at the top, then each stage narrowing it down.

6
00:00:17,594 --> 00:00:20,966
Choose the market and direction, then make your own copy.

7
00:00:31,177 --> 00:00:32,586
Give it a name.

8
00:00:34,579 --> 00:00:39,274
At the top of the funnel, the pool: here, the top one hundred coins by market cap.

9
00:00:39,734 --> 00:00:42,679
Each stage asks one question on its own chart.

10
00:00:42,729 --> 00:00:46,485
Drag a Set onto a stage to change it, even one of your own.

11
00:00:46,949 --> 00:00:48,678
Save and activate.

12
00:00:48,728 --> 00:00:51,204
It's checked straight away, then every hour.

13
00:00:51,658 --> 00:00:55,066
Your funnel shows as Dynamic funnel above the signal tables,

14
00:00:55,086 --> 00:00:57,099
with alerts on new Candidates.
